  "content": "\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n<h3><b>Punchy - Shubba Totem</b></h3>\n<span>使用 <b>Punchy 模型部件</b>，將不朽圖騰轉化為時尚的 3D Shubba。此套件提供完整的 3D 模型與流暢的物品動畫，確保在介面、第一人稱及第三人稱視角下的外觀保持一致。</span>\n</div>\n<br>\n<div align=\"center\">\n<img alt=\"需安裝 Punchy\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/35e17bcff24fe173bf6cdab93344da8318299293_0.webp\" width=\"20%\"/>\n</div>\n<br>\n<div align=\"center\">\n<img alt=\"圖騰實機展示\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Q5s8pFzG/images/d80f747d11d46049ec96c8ff03be9bbdab18795d.gif\" width=\"100%\"/>\n</div>\n<div align=\"center\">\n<img alt=\"圖騰實機展示\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d0725d2272ace762ecf8c2add6307fe497a2c768.gif\" width=\"100%\"/>\n</div>",
